OL,3,AMum quits job as lawyer to voice
OL,4,ANetflix cartoon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum says she left her late-night
OL,7,Flegal career behind for voiceover work
OL,8,Ffrom home where she can care for her
OL,9,Fchildren.
OL,11,FEmily McGonagle started her working
OL,12,Flife as a lawyer in the capital, often
OL,13,Ffinishing at 03:00, but started to
OL,14,Fquestion whether she could sustain it
OL,15,Flong term.
OL,17,FAfter having children, she decided to
OL,18,Fseek something "more flexible" than her
OL,19,Fdaily commute from Colchester to Canary
OL,20,FWharf, and pivoted to voiceover work in
OL,21,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
